content. Licensor may change its advertised pricing by editing
commercial-terms.json, but such changes shall not affect (i) any
then-current executed Agreement or Order Form, (ii) Licensee's rights
under the free-tier or evaluation terms, or (iii) any rights that
vested before the change. No license validator or telemetry may
enforce (or deny service on the basis of) any term other than those
in Licensee's executed, then-current Agreement and Order Form.

